ore__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-xyinfehy4qr"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">What is Nitro Apps?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-ejb0217ofn6" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Fontify allows you to change any Google or Custom font for your website easily. You can apply specific fonts for different sections of your page or for the whole page. Freely find various stunning fonts from our Google font library. Or upload any branded fonts you already have. This app saves you tons of wasting time &amp; cost to bring a professional, consistent look for your store.<br></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-8p8ytrcmj1m" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-8p8ytrcmj1m"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">What is Fontify?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-t4wo6u4xltr" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed"><div><div><div>Yes, Fontify offers a Free plan in which you can access to all Google Fonts available. You are able to apply your Google fonts for certain elements/pages on your website, certain devices and certain languages as well. In case you want to use Custom fonts, you may consider the Premium plan.&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-p2cuhzgrsi" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-p2cuhzgrsi"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">How do I install Fontify?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="2"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-8j6f4l9j3c" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Fontify supports all types of fonts, both Google and custom ones. With Free plan, you can access and use all Google fonts. With Premium plan, additionally you can upload any custom font and also store your Google fonts outside Google Server (inside Fontify server) - which makes your font 100% GDPR complaint.<div></div></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-gdiupxbp6f9" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-gdiupxbp6f9"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">Can I use custom fonts with Fontify?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="3"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-7a8gv7juads" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">If you're selling for EU customers, then you must use Google Fonts stored outside Google Server to make sure your customer IP addresses is secured (otherwise it violates GDPR law. <a href="https://the4.co/blogs/shopify-themes/using-google-fonts-violates-gdpr-reasons-and-solutions" target="_blank"><b>See more</b></a>). Fontify provides local server to store all of your Google Fonts so that you are 100% GDPR compliant. This is a feature on Premium plan.&nbsp;</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div></div></div> </div></div> </div></div></div></div> <div class="ecom-column ecom-core core__column--last ecom-q5b3posbzd"><div class="core__column--wrapper"><div class="ecom-column__overlay"><div class="ecom-overlay"></div></div><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-animation ecom-block ecom-core core__block elmspace ecom-cvbawljhyi" data-core-is="group"><div class="ecom-core ecom-group core__block ecom-5dz8abgxbkv"> <div class="core__group--wrapper ecom-accordion__wrapper ecom-flex ecom-column ecom-w__full ecom__element ecom__accordion ecom-accordion-close-all" data-r="" style=""><div class="core__group--items"><div id="ecom-69winvajd98" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-69winvajd98"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">What is Nitro Lookbook?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="0"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-htlzfdynrd9" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">Yes you can cancel your subscription anytime and it will auto down to Free plan. In that case, your Custom Fonts and Google Fonts Hosted Locally (Premium plan features) will be unpublished on your site. Other Google fonts are still working normally (as in Free plan)<br></div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-5xnckhels5l" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-5xnckhels5l"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" style="order: 1;"><svg version="1.1" id="lni_lni-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" x="0px" y="0px" viewBox="0 0 64 64" style="enable-background:new 0 0 64 64;" xml:space="preserve" fill="currentColor"><g><path d="M61,33.8H3c-1,0-1.8-0.8-1.8-1.8c0-1,0.8-1.8,1.8-1.8h58c1,0,1.8,0.8,1.8,1.8C62.8,33,62,33.8,61,33.8z"></path></g></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_wrapper-info ecom-flex ecom-al_center"><span class="ecom-items--icon ecom-accordion_icon-title"></span><h3 class="ecom-accordion__title-text ecom-items--text">How do I create a lookbook with Nitro Lookbook?</h3></div></div><div class="core__group--body ecom-accordion__body"><div class="core__blocks" index="1"><div class="core__blocks--body"><div class="ecom-block ecom-core core__block ecom-o47ry8c4io" data-core-is="block"><div class="ecom__element ecom-element element__text" data-stopdrag="" deep="2"><div class="text-content ecom-html has-drop-cap-view-framed">You're able to submit refund request within 7 days from the subscription date. After that time, a refund request can only be considered if there has been a substantial problem with your Fontify account, resulting in data loss or significant disruption.&nbsp;Please contact our livechat support in-app for refund assistance.</div></div></div> </div></div></div></div><div id="ecom-7zzr0l5og4b" class="core__group--item ecom-accordion__item" data-id="ecom-7zzr0l5og4b"><div class="ecom-accordion__title ecom-flex ecom-w__full ecom-al_center ecom-items"><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon" style="order: 1;"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 512 512" fill="currentColor"><path d="M488 231.1C501.3 231.1 512 242.7 512 255.1C512 269.3 501.3 279.1 488 279.1H280V488C280 501.3 269.3 512 255.1 512C242.7 512 231.1 501.3 231.1 488V279.1H23.1C10.74 279.1-.0006 269.3-.0006 255.1C-.0006 242.7 10.74 231.1 23.1 231.1H231.1V24C231.1 10.75 242.7 0 255.1 0C269.3 0 280 10.75 280 24V231.1H488z"></path></svg></div><div class="ecom-accordion_nav--icon ecom-items--icon ecom-items-icon-active" styl